BotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Claimed songful-groovelike-horsemouse after signed plan-review PASS. Executable shape: one childless code task with four recorded test-file impacts and no descendants. Worktree /Users/joeoakhart/ci-clock-window-optimization, branch ci-clock-window-optimization, base origin/main 95f97cbeb6. Direct single-change Gerrit landing; no feature branch or parallel implementation. Adopted advisory constraints: >=50% median reduction per changed family, >=20s aggregate focused wall saving, production budgets unchanged, existing real process/lock/socket/health boundaries retained.","timestamp":1786831507461526001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Baseline and contract-card freeze on origin/main 95f97cbeb6, CI-matched extras installed. Three focused runs: 56.82s, 55.72s, 56.22s; median 56.22s, all 26 tests passed. Family medians: reviewbot ensure two calls ~15.08s plus fixture setup, lock retry family ~17s, shutdown/shared-budget pair 9.14s, autodeploy bound-reset/unreachable pair ~13.07s. Contract cards: lock—real separate holder process and dual-window flock/mkdir; holder outlives one pass; retry succeeds without replay, exhaustion emits per-pass warnings/cumulative wait, retries=0 remains exact negative control. Shutdown—real lifespan/reconcile thread path; queue review consumes most of one test-owned drain budget, reconciler receives only remainder; no-review slow fetch bypasses drain; votes/completion, timeout handed to asyncio.wait, and empty drain calls are exact postconditions. Autodeploy—real bash entrypoint and process stubs; first busy tick opens one episode, aged episode remains bound across target changes; unreachable old bot is fail-open and replacement proceeds; interrupt/defer markers and compose actions are exact postconditions. Ensure-ticket profile has no clock/window seam: its cost is real clone/fetch/reconvergence/ensure/write durability, so it is retained unchanged rather than weakening that integration contract. All tests are gating default-tier nodes under the CI pytest command.","timestamp":1786832034908253001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"GREEN/preflight milestone. Three-file test-only diff; no production/config default changed. Focused median 56.22s -> 29.31s, saving 26.91s (47.9%); each modified family >50%, aggregate >20s. Exact-defect final-oracle RED evidence: lock retry disabled 2 failures; fresh shutdown budget plus removed in-flight gate 2 failures; deferral reset plus unknown-as-busy 2 failures. Green: 142 focused tests in 51.42s; dedicated autodeploy health-gate 4 passed; make lint PASS; make typecheck PASS; CI-shaped default 13,582 passed/17 skipped in 1089.09s; integration 167 passed/2 skipped in 114.11s. reviewbot ensure retained unchanged as real integration cost. Surface parity: CLI, MCP/API, library facade, automated production callers, and dual-direction are all out of scope because production behavior is byte-for-byte unchanged; the test suite itself is the only changed surface. Held-out implementer ceremony accepted as not applicable to a small test-harness-only leaf; no new production implementation exists to overfit, and exact-defect mutations independently proved every shortened oracle.","timestamp":1786835093877252001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Pushed fbab3290ba as Gerrit 1824 / Change-Id I87f7c818be79ccc55abfc75b2887ea43a7401422. Local attested review-code PASS with zero findings. Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1, then autonomous Submit.","timestamp":1786835549070954001}],"created_at":1786831481371055001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"6cadb0ce-4136-4467-b473-7615be36df9e","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c7e4-4df1-1477-4db1"}],"des